usage: engineering_de.py [-h] --dataset {IMDB,PubMed} --output OUTPUT
                         --dictionaries DICTIONARIES

Four combination cells, at most TWO disposable normal2 updates each. No
scientific training entry, no reverse chain, no sampled state/graph. Run one
dataset per selected GPU; inherited OABC launchers are not DE launchers.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --dataset {IMDB,PubMed}
  --output OUTPUT
  --dictionaries DICTIONARIES
